{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51219","headline":"五言白话诗 二十六 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂出门前观，川原足故塚。\n富者造山门，贫者如破瓮。\n年年并舍多，岁岁成街巷。\n前死後人埘，鬼补悲声送。\n纵得百年活，还入土孔笼。\n（以上《炖煌掇琐》三一引伯希和卷三二一一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}